mcp-server-ollama (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rename source/binary package mcp-ollama-python to mcp-server-ollama and
    the Python module to mcp_server_ollama; /usr/bin/mcp-ollama-python is kept
    as a compatibility symlink.
  * Add companion package mcprack-mcp-server-ollama registering the server in
    the local mcprack catalog.
  * Add DEP-8 smoke test using `mcprack server probe`.

